WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:06.100
Oars, the ancient giant, was Joyboy. This
is one of the most popular and crazy sounding

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.620
one piece theories in existence. So i sat
down for the last 48 hours straight, and gathered

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:17.010
all the evidence I could find on the internet
to see if its plausible. And I ended up going

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:22.530
down a rabbit hole so deep, it made me question
everything I thought I had known about One

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.699
Piece, especially with recent events in the
manga. Here’s what I found.

00:00:26.699 --> 00:00:31.109
Starting with what we know for a fact about
the mysterious figure Joy Boy and the even

00:00:31.109 --> 00:00:36.450
more mysterious race of ancient giants in
One Piece. We know that Joyboy lived about

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:41.820
800 years ago, around the time of the Void
Century. We know that he had a promise with

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.590
Fishman Island that he would raise the Noah
with the help of Poseidon, but for an unknown

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.160
reason that promise was broken.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:53.020
We also know that Joyboy was a companion of
Zunesha.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:58.210
At some point, Joyboy also left an unimaginable
treasure behind at the end of the Grand Line

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:02.000
- a treasure now known as the One Piece.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.760
Joyboy also proclaimed on the poneglyphs that
he would return in 800 years’ time. Enter

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:13.890
Luffy, who upon unlocking Gear 5th for the
first time, was proclaimed by Zunesha to be

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:15.960
the second coming of Joyboy.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.689
But wait…if we’re talking about Oars being
Joyboy…some of you are probably already

00:01:20.689 --> 00:01:25.040
thinking about a potential problem. If we
look back to Thriller Bark, it’s stated

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:31.070
that Oars died around 500 years ago. Morai
found him frozen in the land of ice.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:38.570
Now, I’m no mathematician but 800 and 500
are two different numbers. Doesn’t that

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:43.390
throw a wrench into this whole theory already?
Well, no.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:47.899
there are 2 reasons for this: First: As we’ll
discuss in more detail, there are actually

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:53.031
2 candidates for Joy Boy. One is the oars
that Luffy fought on Thriller bark. We know

00:01:53.031 --> 00:01:58.350
that regular giants have crazy long lifespans.
After all, Dorry and Broggy were casually

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:04.420
dueling for 100 years. Ancient Giants, who
are multiple times taller than regular giants

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:08.080
could have an even *longer* lifespan.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:12.540
Also with the ice preserving Oars’ tissue,
the dating could just be wrong, making his

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:19.879
death look more recent than it actually was.
However, let’s say Oars lived around the

00:02:19.879 --> 00:02:25.810
time the explorer Nolan lived in One Piece.
It could also have been Oars’ ancestor.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:32.459
Oars Junior is Oars the 3rd. That means there
was an Oars the second. The giant Skull on

00:02:32.459 --> 00:02:37.860
Onigashima has a good chance to be related
to Oars as well. This could make Moria’s

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:46.409
Oars the II and this one Oars the I, and therefore
JoyBoy. We’ll get to that in just a second.

00:02:46.409 --> 00:02:51.540
But i want to stick with the frozen-in-Ice-thing
for a moment. Because it is one of the themes

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:57.720
that unites all ancient giants in the story.
When Moria dug up Oars, he was frozen in ice

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:05.220
- but this is far from the only frozen giant
we’ve seen in the series. In Punk Hazard

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:10.549
there were a bunch of frozen preserved giants.
The Yeti Cool brothers were some icy giants

00:03:10.549 --> 00:03:12.180
also on Punk Hazard.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:17.680
The man who froze half of Punk Hazard, Aokiji,
froze one of our favorite giants on Ohara-

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:25.840
Jaguar D. Saul. And he also froze the new
Joy Boy Luffy. And in a giant freezer in Mariejois,

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:32.440
Imu keeps a giant frozen straw hat. One that
happens to be appropriately Oars sized. The

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:38.030
straw hat by the way, is the second thing
ancient giants seem to share. Next to the

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:43.180
giant one in Marijois, you have the Yeti Cool
brothers wearing straw hats, just like Luffy,

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:48.810
Saul wore a hat, Oars Junior got a straw hat
from ace and as we know, Moria’s oars was

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:51.099
looking for a straw hat as well.

00:03:51.099 --> 00:03:55.410
Now these are all facts that we have seen
in the story. But this was just the first

00:03:55.410 --> 00:04:02.020
of 5 levels that I discovered. This goes much
much deeper And the last level is a theory

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:07.820
so insane, that if true would change one piece
forever as we know it.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:13.519
So let’s look at the core of this theory:
Are there actually signs or even better evidence,

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:17.220
that Ors was Joy Boy, Luffy’s predecessor.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:21.900
Simply from a power perspective, Oars seems
to definitely qualify for the role of JoyBoy.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:27.970
You probably remember, that Moria once challenged
and got defeated by Kaido in Wano, when he

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:33.170
was still a Rookie. That’s when he took
Ryuma’s body to turn him into a Zombie.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:40.410
And Moria had still not given up on becoming
Pirate King and challenging the Yoko. He thought

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:46.169
that with Oars’ zombie, even if not with
the full strength of the original, he could

00:04:46.169 --> 00:04:53.199
defeat Kaido. Moria has the bodies of people
like Ryuma and Captain Jon, one of the former

00:04:53.199 --> 00:04:59.350
Rocks Pirates and still, his master piece
to become pirate king was Oars. He clearly

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:05.350
knew exactly whom he had pulled out of the
ice there. And so did the government.

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:09.860
Zoro’s sacrifice for Luffy and the crew
as well as the battle at Marineford were 2

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:16.720
such incredibly epic moments, that Eiichiro
Oda got to sneak in a very important detail,

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:22.789
pretty much unnoticed: The government tried
to assassinate Moria, not just once, but twice

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:28.190
after they found out that he has recovered
oars. First they sent Kuma and then during

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:34.540
the war at marineford, someone ‘above the
marines’ ordered Doflamingo to take Moria

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:38.970
out. Now there are really not that many people
who could do that. It was either Imu himself

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:44.539
or the Gorosei. An order from the highest
level. The 5 elders and Imu of course know

00:05:44.539 --> 00:05:49.200
about Joy Boy and the void century. They have
worked hard to eradicate any evidence of his

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:54.820
existence or his powers from history. Just
remember how they tried to hunt and discredit

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:59.940
joy boy’s Nika fruit, that was ultimately
stolen by Shanks and eaten by Luffy.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:05.450
Meanwhile, the government themselves want
to create an army of ancient giants as well.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:10.840
As Law explains to us, it would be their ultimate
and unbeatable weapon. The same is true for

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:16.289
Big Mom and Kaido, both of whom know about
Joy Boy. Just remember the giant kids from

00:06:16.289 --> 00:06:22.539
punk hazard, as well as the numbers. Kaido,
who himself has strong Oni features, believed

00:06:22.539 --> 00:06:27.410
himself to be Joy Boy for a while, before
he started looking for someone else who could

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.540
fill that role.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:33.009
Blackbeard and Rocks, two people who most
likely also know more about the true history

00:06:33.009 --> 00:06:37.599
than most others might know about Oar’s
significance as well. Blackbeard’s jolly

00:06:37.599 --> 00:06:44.700
roger are 3 skulls, and 3 skulls can also
be found on both Oars and Oars Jr’s belt.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:51.230
meanwhile, Rocks’ jolly roger, is a skull
with hors. Could be a coincidence and maybe

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:55.629
it means something completely different. We
really don’t know yet.

00:06:55.629 --> 00:07:00.170
We also know that Oars was actively painted
as evil. He is described as the cruel giant

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:04.539
called the continent puller. That’s because
Legend has it that he amassed countries and

00:07:04.539 --> 00:07:09.780
islands under his control and his band of
villains. Now, it’s very plausible that

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:16.910
Oars was a terrible monster. But there is
also a decent chance that things might not

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:22.930
be what they seem here. We do know that the
world government is the Marie Kondo of changing

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:27.830
people’s history and true nature. Does ithis
person inspire love and hope in you? Defame

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:33.080
them. Call them a devil. Get creative and
extinguish the spark of joy for anyone who

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:39.009
tries to rise up against you. Oars being called
a devil goes very well with what we know from

00:07:39.009 --> 00:07:44.680
Nico Robin. And the devil, as you know is
the enemy of god. Now there is a whole lot

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:50.289
of symbolism around the giants and the devil,
that I won’t get into too much here. Saul’s

00:07:50.289 --> 00:07:55.370
biblical name, devil fruits, Adam and eve
tree, you get it. The devils in one piece

00:07:55.370 --> 00:08:01.490
are the good guys. As for the continent pulling,
this hasn’t been officially confirmed, but

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:08.590
it seems pretty clear that Wano is the result
of just that. It’s a mix of different islands

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:13.610
with different climates pulled together, possibly
so that different people and races from across

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:19.270
the world could live there in peace and safety
together. If you remember, Toki, who travelled

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:25.789
into this time period from the Void century
and who is part of the wano clans and culture

00:08:25.789 --> 00:08:32.409
did not actually know where wano was and was
looking for it. The simple explanation here

00:08:32.409 --> 00:08:38.479
could be, that wano as a place simply didn’t
exist yet. Maybe JoyBoy told her of his plans

00:08:38.479 --> 00:08:43.649
to create the island ‘wano’ and told her
to go look for it. This of course goes hand

00:08:43.649 --> 00:08:50.180
in hand perfectly with the gargantuan skull
located right in front of Wano. Possibly Oar’s

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.959
ancestor who died after pulling the islands
together.

00:08:52.959 --> 00:09:00.080
We do know that Zunesha was Joy Boy’s companion,
which would make sense size wise. And Zunesha

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:06.290
heard Joy boy’s return as Luffy awakened
his fruit on top of the gigantic skull. The

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:12.810
same skull, that Kaido, who was obsessed with
Joy Boy’s return, made his headquarters.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:18.160
Now, we have gotten no confirmation yet if
that giant creature was actually alive at

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:24.300
some point, nor who it was. So this could
all just be a bit of a red herring Oda is

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.300
throwing us.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:28.959
Let’s go another Level deeper.
According to most theories, the main piece

00:09:28.959 --> 00:09:34.120
of evidence for one version of Oars being
Joy Boy, is Oar’s supposed parallels and

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.970
connections with Luffy during Thriller Bark.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:43.020
Well, first off, he gets Luffy’s shadow.
Just like Luffy is the 2nd coming of Joyboy,

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:49.970
Luffy and Oars have a direct link. And he
does behave exactly like Luffy. However isn’t

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:55.240
that explained by Luffy’s shadow being inside
him? After all the zombies do take on parts

00:09:55.240 --> 00:10:00.000
of the personality from the shadow they are
infused with. Well there could be an explanation

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.370
for that.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:06.800
Other shadow zombies seem to be in conflict
between the shadow personality and the body’s

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:12.060
original personality. For example, Ryuma’s
original personality and Brook’s shadow

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:15.670
seem to be vying for control.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:24.250
However, Oars is immediately acting like Luffy
and there’s never another sign of any personality

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:30.589
besides that. We could see that as him adopting
Luffy’s personality, but it could also be

00:10:30.589 --> 00:10:37.120
that Luffy and the original Oars were more
alike than we would initially expect.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:42.649
We also see Oars attempt to put on a straw
hat. He doesn’t find a giant straw hat,

00:10:42.649 --> 00:10:48.579
but he does make do temporarily with a piece
of building. Again, this could be interpreted

00:10:48.579 --> 00:10:54.900
as Luffy’s personality looking for his signature
Straw Hat, but we’ve seen a giant Straw

00:10:54.900 --> 00:11:00.940
Hat beneath Mariejois that would be a perfect
fit for this Ancient Giant.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:08.079
Moreover, when Oars attempts to use Gomu-Gomu
techniques…the zombie actually stretches.

00:11:08.079 --> 00:11:13.430
The reasoning we get within the arc is that
the body is just following the shadow. But

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:19.200
is that actually what’s happening? What
if Oars’ body already had rubber properties

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:24.390
because he already had Luffy’s devil fruit
while he was alive? This is something we can

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:29.240
only speculate on for right now. We don’t
have any other cases of a zombie with a devil

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:33.470
fruit power besides Brook’s and that one
isn’t exactly applicable because it’s

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:37.769
a special case. In addition, we haven’t
been able to see whether the body of a devil

00:11:37.769 --> 00:11:44.980
fruit user maintains properties of its fruit.
Would Luffy’s body stay rubbery after death

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:50.020
or would it revert back to normal once the
fruit reincarnates?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:55.490
Oars being already stretchy, instead of suddenly
gaining devil fruit abilities through Moria’s

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:59.630
power is certainly less of a *stretch* than
Luffy’s shadow influencing the corpse to

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:07.430
that degree. otherwise Moria has one of the
most powerful fruits of all time, being able

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.930
to clone abilities.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:15.630
Also, speaking of stretches…this is a real
reach, but if you look at the swirly patch

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:21.620
on Oars’ belly, it even kind of resembles
the pattern of the Gomu-Gomu no Mi.

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:27.370
And let me throw in another few more random
pieces of evidence here: Like Oda making meat

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:32.980
Oar’s favorite food. Or that Oars says that
Luffy is his enemy and introduces himself,

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:39.250
when Sanji addresses him as Luffy. So he seems
to be aware of who he is, just like Ryuma.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:43.639
And on the cover for volume 48 showing oars
and Luffy in the same pose with oars teeth

00:12:43.639 --> 00:12:50.980
giving Luffy horns. Now, could this be more
evidence for the theory? I mean, I guess it

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:56.459
makes sense, but these could all also be explained
differently or as coincidences.

00:12:56.459 --> 00:13:02.860
So let’s give Moria the benefit of the doubt.
Maybe he really has the most ridiculous fruit

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:08.860
in the world. Maybe Oars is simply so much
like Luffy, because Luffy’s shadow is just

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:14.920
that powerful. I personally even think that
this Oars was not Joy Boy at all. It could

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:21.060
well have been foreshadowing for A version
of oars being Joy Boy. Because the gargantuan

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:26.240
skull on Onigashima is still my favorite candidate.
If anything, Thriller bark might have been

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:32.139
more of a giant hint for the real joyboy and
what he was like. Which was most likely, a

00:13:32.139 --> 00:13:33.290
lot llike Luffy.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:39.610
Now Luffy is already confirmed to be Joy Boy,
and we also have seen Luffy turn into a giant

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:45.370
at more than one occasion. Different versions
of gear 5, but in particular his giant form

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:52.410
during his awakening, that allowed him to
beat Kaido. That fist was the size of onigashima,

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:57.011
which would have been the right size of the
creature, who’s skull we see there. Since

00:13:57.011 --> 00:14:03.120
Moria was convinced Oars could defeat Kaido,
maybe he was right about that and foreshadowed

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:11.190
this moment. It’s also that giant fist that
makes Kaido see Luffy as Joy Boy as well before

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.720
he is obliterated.

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:16.220
So let’s say we push aside oars on Thriller
bark for a second here as a candidate for

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:24.459
Joy Boy. Who were these giga giants, like
the skull in Onigashima or on Punk Hazard?

00:14:24.459 --> 00:14:26.570
And where did they go?

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:30.720
Let’s go down another level. This is where
things get super juicy.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:36.041
But first, if you have enjoyed this video
so far and made it to the final level, make

00:14:36.041 --> 00:14:40.860
sure to subscribe for more content like this.
I have a ton of awesome stuff like this coming

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:41.860
up.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:49.329
Now, Oars and Oars Jr are already the largest
giants in One Piece. But they dwarf in comparison

00:14:49.329 --> 00:14:55.380
with these two skulls. The numbers, who are
failed attempts to make ancient giants, easily

00:14:55.380 --> 00:15:01.670
fit inside the giant skull dome to party there.
But as we know, these creatures aren’t the

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:07.580
only enormous things in the One Piece world.
You have giant elephants, seakings, goldfish,

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:12.480
trees, gates. even the tower of Impel Down,
which reaches from the bottom of the ocean

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:20.310
to the surface is up to 10km tall. For comparison
the largest building on earth right now is

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:28.220
the &nbsp;Burj Khalif. And it’s ‘only’ 828-meters
tall. In other words: Impel down is 12 times

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:32.870
taller than the tallest building humanity
has ever built.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:40.949
But clearly, the giant things from the past
have gotten smaller and smaller. Ancient giants

00:15:40.949 --> 00:15:46.740
are getting smaller with each generation,
as are normal giants and even humans. Now

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:52.960
this phenomenon exists in our world too. There
were actual hobbit people and small elephants

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:58.029
that evolved due to something called Island
dwarfism. It’s an evolutionary process that

00:15:58.029 --> 00:16:03.759
reduced body size when a large animal is limited
to a small environment, primarily islands.

00:16:03.759 --> 00:16:09.630
Which, woopty doo, look at that, is just what
we have in One PIece.

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:15.139
Could it be, that the once piece world once
had much much more land for these giant creatures

00:16:15.139 --> 00:16:20.759
to evolve? The one piece world DOES look incredibly
artificial after all, and we have just gotten

00:16:20.759 --> 00:16:26.149
confirmation from the manga, that One Piece
takes place in a post apocalyptical world,

00:16:26.149 --> 00:16:32.750
that used to have advanced technology. There
is Pangea castle on top of the red line, the

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:38.509
only continent in the world. Pangea was the
name of the super continent that we once had

00:16:38.509 --> 00:16:43.589
on earth. And the by now infamous globe on
Ohara with multiple moons also shows something

00:16:43.589 --> 00:16:50.009
that could be the red line, but with many
larger land masses butted up against it, that

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:52.519
clearly don’t exist anymore.

00:16:52.519 --> 00:16:58.339
Could Oda have been inspired by the flood
myth, that exists in pretty much every culture

00:16:58.339 --> 00:17:04.750
in our world as well? Was the world of one
piece flooded until only islands remained?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:09.910
There might be some hints. Most obvious of
all is of course the literal arc noah, an

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:18.720
ancient ship large enough to carry an entire
civilization. You have curious underwater

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:23.490
structures all throughout one piece. The giant
whirlpool and the hole under enies lobbie.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:29.910
Placed directly next to these enormous gates,
larger than anything in one piece, that also

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:34.690
reach down all the way to the bottom of the
ocean. Next to it, Impel Down, a tower that

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:39.830
looks like a defense tower with places to
stand outside and potentially harbouring a

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:45.760
whole nation if under attack from a major
enemy. It also is build from the bottom up,

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:53.070
not the other way around. Places like Alubana
are curiously placed on top of a tall plateau.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:59.309
And in Wano we have already seen an entire
ancient world sunken underneath the water.

00:17:59.309 --> 00:18:05.190
But what on earth could do this? Well, now
that we know of the futuristic technology

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:11.169
that existed in one piece before the void
century, it’s not that hard to imagine really.

00:18:11.169 --> 00:18:17.760
The ancient kingdom was probably even more
advanced than humanity is in our world with

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:24.810
giant robots and space travel. So if we have
the potential to destroy our planet, they

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.340
surely had too.

